        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4621, Barrel Middle Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith a 12 inch c.c., this Barrel Middle Door Pull is great for use as a door handle and also as appliance pull. It is available in 6 finishes including distressed nickel (pictured right) and oil rubbed bronze. It has a contemporary style, one that will blend seamlessly with today's home decor trends. It comes packaged with installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/barrel-middle-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-807\"><b>Barrel Middle Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the PH-4621 12\" Center to Center Barrel Middle Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
